;; Cross-family derivation/process conformance for `spec/Derivations.md`.
;;
;; This is a test-only artefact: it has no `src/` and is not published. The
;; family suites validate their projections in isolation; this tier composes
;; subscriptions, flows, resources, route facts, and machines into one static
;; or live graph and checks the laws that cross those ownership boundaries.
;;
;; ## Why this deps.edn exists
;;
;; The `.cljc` namespace runs in the shared CLJS node gate through
;; `implementation/shadow-cljs.edn`. This alias is the JVM counterpart and is
;; also called by `scripts/test-jvm-implementation.sh`.
;;
;; ## Why test-only deps, not :local/root in :deps
;;
;; Production dependencies remain empty because this artefact ships no code.
;; The `:test` alias supplies the family implementations and exposes only this
;; tier's `test` directory to the test runner; local-root dependencies
;; contribute their source paths, not their test paths.
;;
;; ## Bundle isolation (tools/README.md)
;;
;; This tier depends only on implementation artefacts, never on `tools/`, and
;; no production namespace depends on it. Exercising bundle-isolated tooling
;; namespaces here therefore does not widen a production bundle.
{:paths []
 :deps  {}

 :aliases
 {:test
  {:extra-paths ["test"]
   ;; Core carries the composer and subscription contributor; the optional
   ;; artefacts carry the other four family contributors.
   :extra-deps  {day8/re-frame2           {:local/root "../core"}
                 day8/re-frame2-flows     {:local/root "../flows"}
                 day8/re-frame2-resources {:local/root "../resources"}
                 day8/re-frame2-routing   {:local/root "../routing"}
                 day8/re-frame2-machines  {:local/root "../machines"}
                 ;; Resource and machine schemas need Malli on the JVM classpath.
                 day8/re-frame2-schemas   {:local/root "../schemas"}
                 day8/re-frame2-test-quiet {:local/root "../test-quiet"}
                 io.github.cognitect-labs/test-runner
                 {:git/tag "v0.5.1" :git/sha "dfb30dd"}}
   :main-opts   ["-m" "re-frame.test-quiet.runner"]}}}
